Description: Apply the split-eye output swap to both screencast paths
 The phone panel reaches its screen through this pair, so its output swap
 selects the source eye once, for both scene painting and composed-eye copies.
 Ordinary output capture and DRM output conversion remain unchanged.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos
Forwarded: not-needed, edition stereo output integration
Last-Update: 2026-11-21

